{"title": "Saviour's Allure", "pageid": 28563, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Saviour's_Allure", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Saviour's Allure</b> is a passive feature that increases the wearer's healing.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You restore an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">2</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> every time you heal another creature. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Restorative_Gravity\" title=\"Ring of Restorative Gravity\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Restorative_Gravity\" title=\"Ring of Restorative Gravity\">Ring of Restorative Gravity</a></span>&nbsp;<i>(unobtainable)</i></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Salving\" title=\"Ring of Salving\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Salving\" title=\"Ring of Salving\">Ring of Salving</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202010\nCache expir